      "text": "A criminal alien in Sacramento, already ordered to leave the U.S. after racking up two DUIs, brazenly defied the law by re-entering the country under a completely different identity just months later! \n\nThis blatant disregard for our nation's laws is unacceptable and will not be tolerated. @ICEgov picked him up at our office and will give him a safe and sober ride out of the country. Applying for a Green Card for an alien relative means all parties must be law abiding.",
